SUMMARY:Special Event: Michelle Collins
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 2031 Sansom Street\, Philadelphia
DESCRIPTION:Michelle is a TV and radio personality and comedian who has bee
 n performing her new stand-up hour Wait\, Why Don’t I Know You ? in LA an
 d NY. Her 2024 The Big Natural Tour also wrapped to sold out shows\, rave r
 eviews\, and a slot as a NY Times Critics Pick. She hosts The Michelle Coll
 ins Show every day featuring interviews\, news\, and a stream-of-consciousn
 ess energy that has become her signature style\, taking the show to Patreon
  after hosting it on SiriusXM's Radio Andy for 5 years. She is the co-host 
 of On The Box\, the official Britbox recap podcast produced by the BBC. She
  recently headlined The Three Clubs for the 2026 Netflix is a Joke festival
  and sold-out Dynasty Typewriter in LA.\n\nMichelle is one of a handful of 
 lucky ladies who can call herself a former host of ABC's The View alongside
  Whoopi Goldberg\, as well as hosting a slew of reality TV after shows for 
 ABC's Bachelor In Paradise\, TLC's 90 Day Fiancé?\, and Lifetime's Married
  at First Sight. She is a frequent contributor and co-host on the 4th hour 
 of NBC's The Today Show is a recurring guest on Bravo's Watch What Happens 
 Live\, and was a featured moderator at Bravo's Bravocon this past November.
  She toured the country with cast of Netflix's “Queer Eye” last year\, 
 opening for and moderating the beloved cast of the hit show.\n\nCouple's Pa
 ckage includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per
  person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\nManagement reserves the right 
 to prevent customers from entering the facility who they deem disruptive or
  dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atl
 as/event/special-event-michelle-collins/
